# POLLY, styleknob: the song has a style; the Style knob (the Song page's KNOB 1, PRESETS there, KNOB 4 on the
# Song patterns pages) shows it always and changes the sections that play the style. A section recorded into
# (a user pattern) keeps its pattern, while playing too (nothing to save first); the header says which ("Pop,
# A user"). The job Back to style (SAVE held on the Pattern page) puts the style's section back, the user
# pattern kept. A song all on user patterns keeps a style for them.
wait 300
expect song1_sty 32
expect songtext_is_Pop 1
tap PLAY
wait 4100
expect sect 2
tap REC
tapkey 7
wait 600
tap REC
expect song1_style1 0
expect slot1_nev 70
expect dirty 1
expect songtext_is_Pop,_A_user 1
shot user_a.png
# KNOB 1 while playing: Funk for the other five, Main A's take plays on
tap HOME
spin K1 1
wait 50
expect msg_is_STYLE 1
expect msg_is_UNSAVED 0
expect song1_sty 38
expect song1_style0 38
expect song1_style1 0
expect song1_style2 40
expect song1_style5 43
expect slot1_nev 70
expect songtext_is_Funk,_A_user 1
shot funk_a_user.png
# PRESETS on the Song page and KNOB 4 on the Song patterns pages: the same
turn PRESET 1
wait 50
expect song1_sty 44
expect song1_style1 0
tap ENV
tap ENV
spin K4 -1
wait 50
expect song1_sty 38
expect song1_style2 40
expect song1_style1 0
# Back to style, while playing with the take unsaved: refused (a save pauses the audio)
tap SEQ
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
shot back_job.png
tap SEL
wait 50
expect msg_is_UNSAVED 1
expect song1_style1 0
# stopped: saved first (P01 kept), then Main A plays Funk's
tap PLAY
wait 100
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect msg_is_BACK 1
expect song1_style1 39
expect pat0_nev 70
expect songtext_is_Funk 1
# again on a section playing the style: it says so
press SAVE
wait 800
release SAVE
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
spin K1 1
tap SEL
wait 50
expect msg2_is_plays_the_style 1
# a song all on user patterns: the knob sets its style, the six keep their patterns
poke_user_songs
reboot
wait 300
expect song1_sty 32
expect songtext_is_Pop,_all_user 1
tap HOME
spin K1 2
wait 50
expect song1_sty 44
expect song1_style0 0
expect song1_style1 1
expect song1_style5 5
expect songtext_is_Rock,_all_user 1
tap SAVE
wait 50
reboot
wait 300
expect song1_sty 44
# SEL + black key 1 stopped: "FIRST Intro", gone once PLAY starts it
tap HOME
press SEL
tapkey b0
release SEL
expect msg_is_FIRST 1
tap PLAY
wait 20
expect msg 0
expect sect 1
tap PLAY
